  apply ChainAccess.cons ⟨block0_access (mem0 mem b1 b2 b3 sp s0 s3 ra s2 a0 s1) sp s0 s3 ra s2 a0 s1  _ ,
    block0_control sp s0 s3 ra s2 a0 s1  _⟩
